@node pfs3aio_tools "pfs3aio tools"
@{b}@{u}pfs3aio tools@{uu}@{ub}

Three commands change settings of a mounted PFS3 volume through the
handler. Without a value each shows the current setting.

----------------------------------------
@{"<< Prev" link Main}  @{"Contents" link Main}  @{"Next >>" link setdeldir}

@endnode

@node setdeldir "setdeldir"
@{b}setdeldir@{ub}

@{fg highlight}
  setdeldir DEVICE/A,DELDIRSIZE/N
@{fg text}

Sets the number of blocks of the delete directory ( @{fg shine}.DELDIR@{fg text} ) from 0 to
32, and 0 switches it off. Each block holds 31 deleted files. Making it
smaller removes the deleted files in the blocks it drops. When the disk
is full, it stops at the blocks it could add. The size cannot change
while the delete directory or a deleted file is locked, for example open
or the current directory of a shell.

Example: @{fg shine}setdeldir DH0: 8@{fg text}

----------------------------------------
@{"<< Prev" link pfs3aio_tools}  @{"Contents" link Main}  @{"Next >>" link setfnsize}

@endnode

@node setfnsize "setfnsize"
@{b}setfnsize@{ub}

@{fg highlight}
  setfnsize VOLUME/A,FILENAMESIZE/N
@{fg text}

Sets the maximum length of file names, at least 30 and the current
maximum, at most 107. It cannot be made smaller.

Example: @{fg shine}setfnsize DH0: 107@{fg text}

----------------------------------------
@{"<< Prev" link setdeldir}  @{"Contents" link Main}  @{"Next >>" link setlargefile}

@endnode

@node setlargefile "setlargefile"
@{b}setlargefile@{ub}

@{fg highlight}
  setlargefile VOLUME/A,ENABLE/S
@{fg text}

@{fg shine}ENABLE@{fg text} switches on large-file support for files of 4 GiB and more. It
needs the large-file handler ( @{fg shine}pfs3aio-largefile@{fg text} ) and a @{fg shine}PFS\2@{fg text} volume.
The normal handler answers "Command not supported by this device" and a
@{fg shine}PFS\1@{fg text} volume "Volume is not large file capable.". It cannot be switched
off. Without @{fg shine}ENABLE@{fg text} it shows whether it is on.

Example: @{fg shine}setlargefile DH0: ENABLE@{fg text}

----------------------------------------
@{"<< Prev" link setfnsize}  @{"Contents" link Main}

@endnode
